window.products.push({"id":904260,"name":"Cordless Vacuum, 20KPa Max Suction Stick Vacuum Cleaner, 4-in-1 Lightweight Handheld Vacuum and LED Headlights Brush, Powerful Dust and Pet Hair Clean","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UkmhndHbL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"【Ultra-Strong 7K-20KPa Suction for Most Dirt】With a built-in high speed digital motor, the cordless vacuum could work up to 70,000 Revolutions Per Minute. Hence the suction power could be performed in 7KPa standard mode and 20KPa in high-speed mode. It can pick up most domestic dirt, such as invisible dusts, pet hairs and bread crumbs. 【High-Efficiency 4-Stage Filtration System】Vacuubo wireless vacuum is designed to capture and filtrate the microscopic dust and bacteria, providing an excellent cleaning experience for daily life. The filtration system is composed of four stages, including cyclone, cylinder, ultra-structure sponge and nano-tech strainer. It improves your life environment in a smooth and careful way. 【Multiple Brushes Meet Your Daily Cleaning Needs】Better than other models, this stick vacuum cleaner comes with 2 different rollers brushes and 3 more functional brushes. The basic roller brush could be used for hard floor, and the other one could be used in both carpets and hard floor. The other curtain brush, crevice brush and bedding brush can extend your cleaning area to every corner of your home. So you can clean up all the rooms without changing any complicated tool. 【Convenient Charge with a Detachable Lithium Battery】With a detachable 2200mAh lithium battery, the wireless vacuum cleaner can work up to 30 minutes in standard mode. Just detach the battery from the main machine and charge it anywhere that is convenient for you. It can also easily switch to Max mode with a simple press. In addition, you can purchase an extra battery to use in turn and extend the vacuum working time. 【Lightweight for Long-Time Holding】A great vacuum can make your life a difference when you are trying to suck up that dirt and animal hair which lying on the floors of everywhere. Vacuubo cordless vacuum is much lighter than the wired counterparts and it is quicker to set up and tear down, so you can get the house tidied up easily even if you are on a time crunch.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UkmhndHbL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VACUUBO","source_asin":"B07VRCM5Q3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-904260","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VRCM5Q3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VRCM5Q3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
