window.products.push({"id":904360,"name":"Stainless Steel Shower Caddy JSVER Wall Mounted Bathroom Shelf Rustproof Stainless Steel Bath Shower Shelf Basket Caddy Square Modern Style Shower Bas","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-dCcl+k-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Specifications: Materials: 304 Stainless Steel Surface: Brushed Stainless Steel Dimensions: 9.06*3.94*2.36 inches/23*10.2*6cm Weight: 18.52oz/525g Maximumweight supported: 22lbs/10kg Model: JSVER-BS2301 Features: Holds adecent amount of shampoo, conditioner, body wash and other bathroom necessities When youare ready to take down or move it, it comes off cleanly with no holes. Lets youfearlessly install it without nails or tools Helps tokeep your walls looking beautiful Pleasenote: Do not use on rough or non-stick surfaces such as textured walls, paintedwalls or wallpaper. Installation Instructions: A. Installing with glue 1. Wipe the wall with a clean cloth; 2. Mark a level line; 3. Apply three or four straight lines of glue on the back of the unit (NOT the 3M adhesive area) that will touch the wall; 4. Tear off the protective film of the 3M adhesivetape; 5. Paste the unit to the wall and press hard for at least three minutes until the glue begins to bond; 6. Use the stickers to keep the unit still for at least 48 hours. If you want to remove the unit, just aim the hair dryer at the bonding area and blast it with heat for 3-5 minutes. B. Installing with screws 1. Measure up; 2. Mark the two anchor locations; 3. Drill out the two wall anchors; 4. Tap them in and then drill in the two screws. Package Includes: 1 x JSVER Bathroom Shelf 1 x User Manual 2 x Screws 2 x 3M Adhesive Tapes 2 x Stickers","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-dCcl+k-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JSVER","source_asin":"B0828WK6NH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-904360","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0828WK6NH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0828WK6NH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":904361,"name":"Avenco Washable Breathable Pillow Cases","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51yj1zC-YpL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Are you tired of sleeping with the bed pillows that not right for you? Why is it so hard to find the perfect bed pillows for sleeping? - Down pillows for sleeping are usually too warm to trap in moistures to cause odor or others.  - Regular fiber filling pillows lack support.  - Traditional memory foam pillows suffer from heat build-up from lack of airflow and unadjustable. Why choose Avenco adjustable standard pillows? 1. Perfectly create a balance between comfort and support. The Avenco firm pillow for neck and shoulder pain support. The resilient mixed combination of foam will adjust to each position you sleep in.  2. All the foam certified by CertiPUR-US. Avenco bed pillows have no harmful substances to the human body.  3. Adjustable. Perfect for side, back, stomach, and pregnant sleepers. Easy customize your side sleeper pillow.  4. The Gel Foam inside works well to improve air circulation and release trapped heat as a cooling pillow.  5. Worry-free purchase and great after-sales support. We offer a 3-year warranty. Important Notice: This shredded memory foam pillow is soft but firm, it is possible for you to experience some discomfort during the first two weeks while your body is trying to adjust to the correct position.  There might be a little smell with brand new foam enrolled, which is normal and harmless. Take out the foam and put it in a ventilated place, the smell will go away in a few days. Package included: 1 X Avenco Adjustable Standard Pillow Cut Size 20x26 Inches  1X Extra Foam Filling  1X User Manual & Warranty Card Order NOW!! Try our comfortable and supportive bed pillow to enjoy a good cool sleep all night long.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51yj1zC-YpL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Avenco","source_asin":"B07R6RNZL6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-904361","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07R6RNZL6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07R6RNZL6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
