window.products.push({"id":904445,"name":"HFHOME Coffee Pod Drawer, Compatible with 60 Original Capsules, Nespresso Originaline Capsule Storage Drawer Holder, Coffee Pod Holder for Oraginal Po","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OWguUyj1L._AC_SL1498_.jpg","description":"【GREAT CAPABILITY】- HFHOME Coffee Pod Holder can hold up to 60 OriginalLine coffee capsules. The pods are divided into 6 columns, clearly distinguishing their flavor and color. Safely stored and always accessible. (Coffee capsules are not included.) 【DRAWER DESIGN】- Easy-open sliding drawer with anti-derailed track and handle design, more convenient to pull and push. The minimalist design of this coffee pod storage is suitable for kitchen or office, and the modern design decorates your home or room like a work of art. 【DELUXE METAL CONSTRUCTION】- Forged from a solid metal frame with a black scratch-resistant grainy powder coat finish. Exquisite and unique grid storage space design. The feet on the bottom are designed with EVA rubber, which can be fixed on a smooth surface. 【DIMENSIONS】- The size of the coffee storage drawer is about 16.1\"L x 10\"W x 2.4\"H. Weight: 3.7 lbs. On the top of the original capsule pods holder, a coffee machine or cup can be placed. 【SPACE SAVING】- Our Original coffee pod storage drawer has a small footprint. Just occupy a small corner of your counter top in the kitchen or living room. Please contact us if you have any questions after purchase. We will serve you wholeheartedly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OWguUyj1L._AC_SL1498_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HFHOME","source_asin":"B0BKLB1PHK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-904445","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BKLB1PHK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BKLB1PHK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":904446,"name":"nuLOOM Arabella Contemporary Bordered Area Rug, 4' x 6', Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1Z-yvzE-CL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"At nuLOOM, we believe that floor coverings and art should not be mutually exclusive. Founded with a desire to break the rules of what is expected from an area rug, nuLOOM was created to fill the void between brilliant design and affordability., The images we display have the most accurate colors possible.Rug Colors, sizes, patterns may vary slightly depending on how your rug is made and the size ordered.Due to different monitor resolutions and lighting you may notice a slight difference in color. Each handmade rug is unique to the artisan who weaved it.These are not considered defects Bunching, Creases and Folded Corners: You may see some creases and bunching in the pile and around the corners when you unroll your new rug. These waves will flatten within 2 -3 weeks as you begin to use your new rug. Use these tricks to help flatten your rug: Back Rolling: Roll the carpet out, then roll it back up reversely with the backside up. Let it sit rolled up reversely for a day or 2, or until it flattens out. Heavy Objects: Lay a piece of heavy furniture or objects on affected areas for a day or 2, or until it flattens out. If the corners are sticking up, curl them back and place heavy objects on affected areas going the opposite way. Heat: Use this technique as a last resort only. Place the rug over a cleared concrete or area like a driveway or sidewalk setting during dry sunny conditions. Allow the rug to be positioned for optimal sunlight as long as possible to give the rug time to absorb the sun's heat for up to 2 hours, but use more time if needed. Blow Dryer: If a large concrete patch with optimal sunlight is not accessible, flip the rug over and use a hair dryer to affected areas to heat up the creases. Always hold the hair dryer 7 to 12 inches away from the rug going side to side on a medium setting, as heat can sometimes cause backing to melt.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1Z-yvzE-CL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"nuLOOM","source_asin":"B08SPZJ5CH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-904446","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08SPZJ5CH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08SPZJ5CH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
