window.products.push({"id":904460,"name":"Cheese Making kit Prime Cheese Moulds 0.4kg/0.88lbs Ricotta + 0.25kg/0.55lbs Camembert Blue+White Original HOZPROM Cheese Making Supplies from The Man","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HCWN3WpGS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cheese making Cheese Molds Set Cheese making mold Ricotta Cheesemaking Milk Fresh cheese Mozzarella Rennet Feta Cheese making supplies cheese | Set of 7 pcs 0.55-0.88 lbs Blue+White Original HOZPROM Blue cheese molds are the basis for making real cheese with an exquisite original taste. Unlike traditional cheese molds , the blue cheese molds is easily cleaned due to the complete removal of cheese grain residues. You can easily remove all the remaining cheese grains in the cheese-shaped cells to prepare another type of cheese without mixing cheese cultures of different cheeses. Therefore, you get the original cheese and enjoy the exquisite taste of your cheese! The cheese mold is made of high-quality food-grade polymer, forms the cheese head of the correct form, provides drainage of cheese grains with the most effective outflow of whey. HOZPROM cheese molding equipment is presented in the form of high-quality molds for the production of soft and hard cheeses, and it will provide the preparation of brine, soft, semi-soft, semi-hard and hard cheeses . The follower form is used to quickly press cheese, to obtain semi-hard and hard cheese. The design of the mold involves the use of a piston load to form the cheese head and the outflow of whey. The simplicity of making cheese using this form at home determined the popularity of the product in farmers and households. The universality of the form with the piston allowed us to consider it as a necessary accessory in the work of cheese makers. To get a delicious cheese of a beautiful structure and uniform density is really - very simple with the mold for hard cheese of the HOZPROM company. Creamy, brine, blue cheese - a firework of tastes in small cheese heads - the gastronomic result of the work of holders of professional cheese molds by Hozprom Cheese Molds Manufacturer","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HCWN3WpGS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hozprom Cheese Molds Manufacturer","source_asin":"B084P2WXB2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-904460","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084P2WXB2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084P2WXB2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":904461,"name":"Le Creuset 2.75-Quart Round Enameld Cast Iron French Oven, Dijon","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qCT+JAwkL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"Versatile enough to handle everything from soup to braised short ribs to cake, this 2-3/4-quart round French Oven in Dijon yellow from Le Creuset also posesses stunning looks that will impress dinner guests. While this popular shape has been around for many centuries before its introduction in the 1920s, the basic design has changed very little. It's made of cast iron, which offers superb heat retention and distribution, and the exterior and interior are clad in two coats of Le Creuset's famous hard-wearing, non-reactive enamel. Food is cooked evenly and gently at low temperatures without hot spots and is suitable for all heat sources. The phenolic knob on its heavy, tight-fitting lid is ovenproof to 375 degrees F. This French Oven also has loop handles for easy lifting. Like all Le Creuset cast-iron products, it is hand cast in a one-of-a-kind sand mold and hand finished at the Le Creuset factory in France. It's dishwasher safe, but handwashing is recommended as continued diswashing may lead to some dulling of the enamel finish--though this is not harmful and will not impair performance. It's best to dry the French Oven thoroughly after washing. This Le Creuset enameled cast iron cookware is covered by a limited lifetime warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qCT+JAwkL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Le Creuset","source_asin":"B000B9RWLK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-904461","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000B9RWLK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000B9RWLK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
