window.products.push({"id":904602,"name":"Croscill Retreat Scalloped Valance, 75 by 17-Inch, Aqua","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A19JFJG9frL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Discover the serenity of a breezy island coast with Retreat bedding ensemble. This Jacobean pattern carries an aura that is effortless as it is fresh. Comforter features a Jacobean pattern printed upon a 100-Percent cotton aqua colored base cloth which has a texture much like that of linen. Added features of the comforter include twist cord trim and printed floral reverse. Shams coordinate directly with the comforter face, with padded flange, twist cord trim and printed reverse. Bed skirt is solid blue with coral grosgrain ribbon embellishments, box pleats and an extra-long 18\" drop. Coordinating sheets are 100-Percent cotton and feature a scrolling vine embroidery along the hems. Euro shams are solid blue like the bed skirt, featuring flange and coral grosgrain ribbon with a border of white vine embroidery. Euro shams reverse to a woven diamond jacquard fabric. Square pillow is solid blue like the Euro shams and bed skirt, with a coral grosgrain ribbon border. Fashion pillow is solid blue with a large scale multicolor floral motif embroidery. Boudoir pillow is dynamic, incorporating an area of engineered printed Jacobean fabric in the center, bordered by coral grosgrain ribbon and diamond jacquard panels on either side. Pillow is finished with piping detail. Window treatments include lined tailored panels with tiebacks and a scalloped valance with tassel fringe, all in the beautiful printed Jacobean design. Drapery panels are sold in sets of two with tie backs included. To achieve this look, use two valances. Euro shams, decorative pillows, drapes and valances are sold separately.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A19JFJG9frL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Croscill","source_asin":"B00BDBA3QQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-904602","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BDBA3QQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BDBA3QQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
