window.products.push({"id":904623,"name":"DECORARTS - The Great Wave off Kanagawa by Katsushika Hoki. Classic Art Reproduction, Giclee print on canvas stretched gallery wrapped 36x24","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":74.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iVAxRT5nL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"Thirty-six Views of Mount Fuji (Fugaku Sanjurokkei) is a series of landscape prints the Japanese ukiyo-e artist Hokusai. The series depicts Mount Fuji from different locations and in various seasons and weather conditions. The breathtaking composition of this woodblock print, said to have inspired Debussy's La Mer (The Sea) and Rilke's Der Berg (The Mountain), ensures its reputation as an icon of world art. Brand Quality: production from one of the world's leading wall decor manufacturers Made in USA: real handcrafted canvas prints produced and hand-stretched in California About Giclee Prints Giclee printing is meant to produce a product at a higher quality and longer lifespan than a standard desktop inkjet printer. There are at least Three basic criteria, which must be met in order for the print to be considered a true giclee... 1. For giclee printing, the paper or substrate used to actually print the final piece must be acid free and consists of a 100% cotton base. 2. Any image that is to be printed as a giclee needs to be created at a resolution of no less than 300 dots per inch (DPI). 3. The last step to creating or confirming a true giclee print is the type of ink and printer used. The biggest contrast between a standard inkjet print and a giclee print is that giclees are printed using pigment-based inks rather than the dye-based inks found in lower cost inkjets. Pigment-based inks have a longer life span that can last anywhere from 100 to 120 years without significant fading.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iVAxRT5nL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DECORARTS","source_asin":"B01FECQ8FY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-904623","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01FECQ8FY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01FECQ8FY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
