window.products.push({"id":904750,"name":"SHYRC 10 Pack Glass Meal Prep Containers with Lids, Airtight Glass Food Storage Containers Leak Proof Glass Lunch Containers(10 Lids & 10 Containers) ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wgcUOXH8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【10 Piece Pink Meal Prep Containers】Includes 10 containers and 10 lids. This glass containers with lids set is made up of five 34-oz containers and five 12-oz containers. Different sized containers can easily meet the needs of meal prep, very suitable for your daily life! 【Sealed and Leak-Proof】Each container is equipped with a sealed lid with silicone gasket and four locking clips that makes the container more airtight, spill-proof and leak-proof. Each container ensures the food could keep fresher and longer. These glass storage containers are easy to clean so that they would look like new after cleaning. 【Refrigerated / Freezing / Microwaveable / Dishwasher Washable】This glass meal prep containers set is perfect for microwave, refrigerator and dishwasher. Just take the prepared food out of the refrigerator/freezer and heat it in the microwave for a quick lunch. You can use them for freezer storage, microwave (not the lids) and dishwasher. 【Strong and Durable Borosilicate Glass】These glass food prep containers are made of borosilicate glass and plastic lids. The transparent glass allows the contents of the container easily be seen without removing the lid so that you can sort, organize and store food better. 【Stackable/Portable】These glass storage containers with lids are made to nest inside each other so that they can be stacked together for a neater kitchen or cabinet. The rectangular containers can be stacked nicely in the cupboards or refrigerators to save space. These glass food containers are very lightweight and portable, perfect for prepping meals at home and bring it to work, the gym, travel or on the go.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wgcUOXH8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SHYRC","source_asin":"B0BXL4PMTZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-904750","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXL4PMTZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXL4PMTZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":904751,"name":"Glass Mugs Coffee Cups 17oz (500ml) with Handles for Espresso Juice Water Milk Set of 2 Jade White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ztQSLIE9L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"About Tianyuan Glass: Huailai Tianyuan Special Type Glass Co.,Ltd. was established on October 9th, 2002,which is the national high technology Enterprise specializes in the research and development, production and sales of colored borosilicate 3.3 glass tubing and rods. The registered capital is 36.8 million yuan, Total assets exceed 450 million yuan. Presently we have more than 8 hundreds employees. Welcome business customer contact us and visit the factory. Features: Material: ISO approved High borosilicate glass Bearing temperature: -20℃ to 150 ℃ （-4 ℉ to 302 ℉ ) microwave safe!!!!! Capacity: 17oz,about 500ml Please note: 1、The cups are handmade, we can't guarantee that the pictures and the locations are exactly the same which is difference from those made by the machine. 3、As glass is fragile,if the items you received is broken,please contact us first. 4、If broken within half a year(not due to human error),please contact us for new or refund. Compared to ordinary glass, borosilicate glass is superior to the former in terms of thermal properties, optical properties, mechanical properties and chemical properties, and has a lower thermal expansion coefficient than ordinary glass.And also has a high thermal shock and surface hardness whitch can prevent scratches, and can be applied to fire-proof, bullet-proof glass. Some customers receive the product, they will think why it is so thin and light, if the quality is terrible?In fact, normally,borosilicate glass products are thinner than ordinary glass products. This is just its feature, but never mind, it is more resistant to low temperature and high temperature. Kettle and cup products can be taken out from the refrigerator and poured directly into hot boiling water without breaking.Please trust the borosilicate.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ztQSLIE9L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TIANYUAN","source_asin":"B07C3P9NVC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-904751","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07C3P9NVC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07C3P9NVC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
