window.products.push({"id":904803,"name":"Vantiorango 6FT Artificial Christmas Tree, 1000 Tips with Metal Stand, Xmas Pine Trees for Indoor Outdoor Festival Holiday Decoration","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814LrBAETKL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"🎄【REALISTIC 6FT CHRISTMAS TREE】The blades of our Christmas pine tree are made from high-quality PVC material, dense and realistic, which not only makes the tree looks more real and more full, but also add the anti-crush capacity to the tree. 🎄【CLASSFIC UNLIT XMAS TREE】This is an unlit Xmas tree, except for the full branches and blades, there no extra things on the tree, perfect for ornaments hanging. We leave the imaginations of decorating to you and your family. 🎄【STURDY METAL STAND】 - Our Christmas tree uses a metal stand instead of a cheap plastic stand. A sturdy metal stand provides the Christmas tree greater support and can be used for a long time. And the plastic cover design on the end of the stand can protect your floor. 🎄【FESTIVE ATMOSPHERE】Great for indoor-outdoor use, especially for Christmas decorations, which can be used to decorate offices, apartments, or any room in a house. Our 6FT Christmas tree surely can be an eye-catching centerpiece to any room during the holidays. It can create a festive warm and romantic atmosphere. 🎄【EASY ASSEMBLY & DISASSEMBLY】 - To finish the assembly of this tree it requires only a few steps, after putting three sections together, all the tree requires you to do is straighten out the branches, so the tree will achieve the best effect.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814LrBAETKL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"vantiorango","source_asin":"B08H7HBSN3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-904803","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08H7HBSN3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08H7HBSN3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
