window.products.push({"id":904932,"name":"BonNoces 34 Ounce Coffee/Tea Thermal Carafe - Stainless Steel Double Walled Vacuum Insulated Heat & Cold Retention-Retro Romantic Presents Unique Hous","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BKohb0iIL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"New style with thermos carafe, absolutely a wonderful addition to your formal gatherings getting raves from your guests, beautiful and elegant, totally will make outstanding and fancy than other thermal carafe. High Quality Food Grade 304 Vacuum insulated double walled stainless steel coffee carafe, friendly to human body and environment. Double walled thermos vacuum insulation technology locks in temperature to preserve flavor and freshness to keep beverages hot for 12 hours or cold for 24. Unique design with artistic exterior shape, cohesion of exquisite patterns. Just beautiful! Idea for Any Occasion like High-end cafe, Home Decoration, friends gathering and entertaining. Think Housewarming Gift, Wedding Gift, Birthday Gift, or Christmas Gift ect. Convenient press-button opens and closes the carafe makes one-handed pouring simple. Coffee carafe holds 1 liters or 34 oz, making it one of the best thermal drink containers for entertaining.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BKohb0iIL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BonNoces","source_asin":"B01LWZBD59","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-904932","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LWZBD59","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LWZBD59","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":904933,"name":"Novelty Grammy 6\" Wide Magnet of Street Sign Design.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.75,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61a8PbaYJiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This is a high quality magnet for vehicles will withstand elements for 3-5 years. The design will be contour cut. Important: For vehicle (and many external applications) remove the sign weekly and wipe dry both the vehicle surface and the back of the sign. This keeps moisture from collecting which can damage a vehicle’s finish. To wash the back of the sign, use warm water and a mild non-abrasive detergent. Remove sign after a snowfall or rain, wipe dry and reapply. Also, remove signs before pressure washing, especially in winter as most car washes use de-icing chemicals that could damage the sign face. To clean printed graphics, use a mild, non-abrasive soap with a soft cloth or sponge. Avoid using alcohol-based cleansers or soaps containing grit or abrasives. Automated vehicle washing systems that use rotary cleaning brushes should also be avoided.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61a8PbaYJiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beach Graphic Pros","source_asin":"B01EW75XBM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-904933","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01EW75XBM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01EW75XBM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
